    <description><![CDATA[
## Install

```powershell
choco install ms-coreutils
```

Chocolatey downloads the official 64-bit installer at install time and runs it silently. The package itself carries no binaries.

Install a specific version:

```powershell
choco install ms-coreutils --version=<version>
```

## What is Coreutils for Windows?

Coreutils for Windows: Installer & Packaging

## Upgrade

```powershell
choco upgrade ms-coreutils
```

## Uninstall

```powershell
choco uninstall ms-coreutils
```

